=== CSS helpers

--- Visually hidden class :: a11y-visually-hidden
Hides content visually but keeps it for screen readers; shows it again when focused.
.visually-hidden:not(:focus):not(:active) {
  clip-path: inset(50%);
  height: 1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  position: absolute;
  white-space: nowrap;
  width: 1px;
}

--- Skip link styles :: a11y-skip-css
Keeps the skip link off-screen until it receives keyboard focus.
.skip-link {
  background: ${1:#000};
  color: ${2:#fff};
  inset-block-start: 1rem;
  inset-inline-start: 1rem;
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
  position: absolute;
  transform: translateY(-200%);
  z-index: 100;
}

.skip-link:focus {
  transform: none;
}

--- Focus ring :: a11y-focus
Visible focus indicator for keyboard users only (WCAG 2.4.7).
:focus-visible {
  outline: ${1:3px} solid ${2:currentColor};
  outline-offset: ${3:2px};
}

--- Reduced motion :: a11y-reduced-motion
Turns off animation and smooth scrolling for users who ask for less motion.
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
  }
}

--- Forced colors :: a11y-forced-colors
Restores borders that Windows High Contrast mode would otherwise remove.
@media (forced-colors: active) {
  ${1:.button} {
    border: 1px solid ButtonText;
  }
}

--- Target size :: a11y-target-size
Minimum 24 by 24 px pointer targets (WCAG 2.5.8).
${1:button, [role="button"], input[type="checkbox"], input[type="radio"]} {
  min-block-size: 24px;
  min-inline-size: 24px;
}

--- Accessibility base styles :: a11y-base-css
Visually hidden class, skip link, focus ring and reduced motion in one block.
.visually-hidden:not(:focus):not(:active) {
  clip-path: inset(50%);
  height: 1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  position: absolute;
  white-space: nowrap;
  width: 1px;
}

.skip-link {
  background: ${1:#000};
  color: ${2:#fff};
  inset-block-start: 1rem;
  inset-inline-start: 1rem;
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
  position: absolute;
  transform: translateY(-200%);
  z-index: 100;
}

.skip-link:focus {
  transform: none;
}

:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid currentColor;
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
  }
}
